        "content": "An error happened in this [issue](https://github.com/ubiquity/onboard.ubq.fi/pull/37): \n```diff\n! Error fetching issue, Aborting\n```\nIf we look at the [Action run](https://github.com/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-pull-review/actions/runs/13390388135) we can see the detailed error:\n```\n⚠ Error fetching issue, Aborting\n\t⚠ {\n\t    \"owner\": \"ubiquity\",\n\t    \"repo\": \"onboard.ubq.fi\",\n\t    \"issue_number\": 275,\n\t    \"caller\": \"PullReviewer.reviewPull\"\n\t  }\n```\nThe plugin is trying to fetch issue 275 in `ubiquity/onboard.ubq.fi` but the PR is linked to issue 275 in `ubiquity-os-marketplace/text-conversation-rewards`\nTo fix it the plugin needs to fetch from the correct organization/owner and repo",
